      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this comment is more general: if we can\u0027t use any hardware blending, we have to perform a dst read.\n\nGiven that, we could just replace all uses of IsDstReadRequired with CanUseHardwareBlending and only have one function. I agree that CanUseHardwareBlending is a more obvious name, and helps differentiate the behavior from the higher-level logic around whether or not the dst color effects the output at all (which can still be true if we are doing HW blending).",
